# =============================================================================
# .gitignore -- this repository is PUBLIC.
# =============================================================================
# The 1.x chart leaked a real 64-hex JWT key, an admin password and a ttyd
# password by committing them in values.yaml. The 2.0.0 chart holds no secret
# at all, and tests/validate.py fails the build if one reappears in
# chart/values.yaml. This file is the second line: it keeps the local files
# that DO hold credentials -- values overrides, kubeconfigs, env files --
# from ever being staged. See docs/MIGRATION.md.
#
# EVERY PATTERN HERE IS ANCHORED WITH A LEADING `/`.
# That is not cosmetic. An unanchored `secrets.yaml` matches a file of that name
# at ANY depth, so the day someone adds `chart/templates/secrets.yaml` git
# ignores it, `git add -A` silently skips it, the chart still renders on the
# author's machine, and the pushed chart is missing a template. Anchored
# patterns match only the repository root, which is where a local override is
# actually written, and cannot reach into chart/templates/ at all.
# tests/chart.test.sh enforces this: it fails if any file under chart/ is
# ignored or untracked.

# --- Local Helm values overrides (these hold real hostnames and, historically,
# --- real secrets). chart/values.yaml, chart/ci/, tests/values/ and
# --- deploy/woow-k3s/ are tracked and must stay tracked.
/values.local.yaml
/values-local.yaml
/*.local.yaml
/*.local.yml
/my-values.yaml
/values.override.yaml
/values-override.yaml
/override-values.yaml
/secrets.yaml
/secret-values.yaml
/*.secrets.yaml
/*-secret-values.yaml
/od-values.yaml

# --- Cluster credentials
/kubeconfig
/kubeconfig-*
/*.kubeconfig
/.kube/
/*.kubeconfig.yaml
/admin.conf

# --- Generic credential material
/.env
/.env.*
!/.env.example
/*.pem
/*.key
/*.p12
/*.pfx
/htpasswd
/.htpasswd

# --- Helm build output
/*.tgz
/chart/charts/
/chart/Chart.lock
/chart/requirements.lock
/helm-render.yaml
/rendered.yaml

# --- Container / build artifacts
/*.tar
/*.tar.gz

# --- Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# --- Test scratch
/tests/.tmp/
/tests/out/
/.playwright-mcp/

# --- Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
